{
  "_README": "Fill every <FILL_...> with the real (redacted) value from the MCP charge canary, then run: node scripts/validate_paid_canary_evidence.mjs --input <thisfile> --json . psp_mode/livemode MUST be test/false. No raw keys, JWTs, client_secrets, bearer tokens, or PANs — the validator rejects them.",
